Modifications by Kalaris Labs
-----------------------------
- Rebranded user-facing names: "Serena Launch" -> "Kuchi",
  "Serena Tan" -> "Kalaris Labs" (scripts/rebrand.py).
- Moved all public URLs from serenatan.org/launchvideo/ to the root of
  kuchi.kalarislabs.com. The MCP endpoint is https://kuchi.kalarislabs.com/mcp.
- Removed the upstream operator's Cloudflare account/zone IDs, D1 database ID,
  Clerk publishable key and PostHog project token. These are now operator
  configuration (see .env.example).
- The gallery Worker serves this repository's site/ UI by default instead of
  fetching HTML from the upstream operator's Pages project (optional UI_ORIGIN).
- Added a public /mcp/health endpoint.
- Added WHITELABEL.md, MIGRATION.md, scripts/rebrand.py and scripts/audit.py.

Third-party content
-------------------
Every launch video, preview image, product name, logo and quoted post in the
catalog belongs to its original creator. Each data/videos.json entry carries a
"source" link to the original post. The MIT license covers the code, curation
and prompts, not third-party media. See WHITELABEL_AUDIT.json for the
redistribution status of each media asset.
